  "visualBrief": "Milano Centrale faces Piazza Duca d’Aosta with a pale limestone portico, three open entrance bays and a taller barrel-roofed concourse. Five glazed train sheds shelter 24 mapped track positions and a raised deck of boarding platforms.",
